MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The HDMI cable was the closest match because I have bought a display cable before and practical connection accessories fit my interests, though I would need a specific HDMI connection to make."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The smart speakers, smart plug, and streaming devices do not solve the computer connection needs reflected in my purchases. Buying adapters does not mean I want home automation or TV entertainment devices.",
    "My earlier headset purchase gives the earbuds some connection to my history, but it does not give me a reason to buy another audio accessory now. The portable speaker and memory card likewise lack a clear current use."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The suggestions seem to treat an interest in computer accessories as an interest in electronics generally.",
    "Several Alexa and streaming devices repeat an assumed interest that I do not see reflected in my purchases."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My WiFi adapter, USB expansion card, display cable, and USB Ethernet adapter suggest that the specific connection a product enables matters more to me than simply being an electronic device.",
    "My purchases are spaced far apart, and I rarely interact without a relevant need. Even a related cable is only useful if it connects equipment I actually need to connect."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions partly recognized my interest in connection accessories but stretched it into an unsupported interest in smart-home and entertainment devices."
}
